      <div class="card shadow mb-4">
        <div class="card-header">
          <strong class="card-title text-uppercase">Executive Summary</strong>
        </div>
        <div class="card-body p-4">
          <p class="lead">A critical remote code execution vulnerability was identified during the routine audit of the <code>/api/v1/internal-sync</code> endpoint. This flaw allows an unauthenticated attacker to execute arbitrary commands with SYSTEM privileges.</p>
          <p>This report outlines the technical findings, proof-of-concept evidence, and the required standard operating procedures (SOP) for remediation and recovery.</p>
        </div>
